/-!
# Atlas V-03 (block C2): the sources of the linearised identities in IV's residuals `L_E`, `L_J`, `L_H`

* `ricF_src_eta0`: for a frame pair with `η_{AK} = 0`, V-02's `ricF_eq_source` and `emStressF_eq` give
  `Ric(e_A,e_K) = 2 Σ_{CD} F(e_A,e_C) η^{CD} F(e_K,e_D) + E(e_A,e_K)` (every null frame, every `F`, off shell).
* `NPFamily.ricFVar_eta0`: its genuine first variation along a family (derivative uniqueness on the open slice):
  `δRic(e_A,e_K) = 2 Σ (δF_{AC} η^{CD} F_{KD} + F_{AC} η^{CD} δF_{KD}) + L_E(e_A,e_K) + E(b_A,e_K) + E(e_A,b_K)`.
* At Kerr–Newman (`KNFam`): `E = 0` (`certReg`), the background frame Faraday matrix has only `F_{ln}`, `F_{m m̄}`,
  and `F_{ln} + F_{m m̄} = Q / q²` (`q = r + i a cos θ`), so
  `δRic_{02} = L_E(l,m) + (2Q/q²) δΦ₀`, `δRic_{13} = L_E(n,m̄) + (2Q/q²) δΦ₂`, and `δRic_{AA} = L_E(e_A,e_A)`
  (`A = 0,1,2,3`); `HfrVar` is the three-frame contraction of `L_H` and `JfrVar` the coframe applied to `L_J`
  (`dF = 0`, `J = 0` at KN). No new stress tensor or residual is introduced. -/

